            <div class="agent-message"><p>I simplified the welcome page and made the next step easier to find.</p><div class="task-done"><span aria-hidden="true">⌄</span> Edited 2 files <small>+24 −8</small></div><p>The project list stays front and center, with a clearer action to start something new.</p><p class="completed"><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span> Completed</p></div>
            <div class="mock-composer" aria-label="Illustrative message composer"><p>Ask anything, @tag files/folders, or use /</p><div class="composer-controls"><span aria-hidden="true">+</span><span class="composer-access">Full access ⌄</span><span class="composer-model">Codex ⌄ &nbsp; GPT-5 ⌄</span><span class="composer-send" aria-hidden="true">↑</span></div></div>
